. *** Generate outcome variable on the household level: the absolute value of d
> ifference between individual cumulated hours worked in household (childcare, 
> chores, repair work) for partners of different genders in the same household
. gen hrs_diff = total_hours_male-total_hours

. gen hrs_diff_sq=hrs_diff*hrs_diff

. gen hrs_diff_sq_sqrt = sqrt(hrs_diff_sq)

. 
